        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJwtmRzHhc3TwFMTNQZOWiI7WCIelOHe-MM1gdMm0VOuur72Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Shaka signature poke bowl is the tastiest. Although very prices 24$+tax. Portions are almost generous - I’d add little bit more more of eel as I see other franchises put little more. This place has now crispy rice - this is great. Service is very kind and friendly.",
        "time": 1769924581,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Suzannah Nicholson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104658640249912974316/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVRnCtM82nMSb6MFG-Ui7Qn-99cBYTIL4DcZzmskAo-v10aAeN7=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "The interior restaurant is very nice, clean, spacious. Ordering was simple and quick.\nI ordered the Honolulu bowl. The portion size is very good and contained a generous amount of fish. Perfect amount of sauce/marinade. Enough to carry the flavour through the bowl, but not too much to be overwhelming.",
        "time": 1768438198,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mackenzie Nguyen",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109955521183074416983/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU__qzf1jIayUQjk3asaXSSXzOyzM9pwQTAfPIGf2MlwkPos1Y=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Very inviting and comfortable atmosphere. The staff was friendly and the food exceeded my expectations. I would recommend",
        "time": 1756063048,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Luinel Ortiz",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115964810249305722352/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK8hMGvHxs6LLn7CH1Tkw9dquGhHjC6TtFkTsYCc1wSPED4Nw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Amazing Poke the best I have tried in years, enough quantity you get out overfilled ; quality vs price, katso and supreme just woww and the spring rolls yummylicious/  They need asap the billboard outside to let people know they are open.",
        "time": 1765157385,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Bianca Vescio",
